  "summary": "Malicious code in dolyame-boxy-markdown (npm)",
  "details": "On require, the package downloads a platform-specific binary from Cloudflare Workers endpoints (oob-worker[.]cf102-baf[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf101-adf[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf103-070[.]workers[.]dev, paths /pkg/package, /pkg/package-arm64, /pkg/loader_mac, /pkg/package.exe) with a DNS-TXT fallback from sdk[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru / ext[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru / pkg[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru / net[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru. The fetched binary is written to /var/tmp/.cache_\u003chex\u003e (or dotnet_diag_\u003chex\u003e.exe on Windows) and executed as a detached background process via cmd.exe /c start /b or /bin/sh -c \"fp \u0026\". A cooldown lock file at /tmp/.analytics_state throttles re-execution.",
